DESCRIPTION:YouTube 21.43.5 | YouMod extra tweaks | YouMod_21.43.5_2.0.0\n\
 n### Latest Release\, ENJOY!!\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> - **YTUHD** is not included.
  4K60HDR is available.\n> - [v2.0.0 release notes](https://github.com/Tonw
 alter888/YouMod/releases/tag/v2.0.0)\n> - no standalone iSponsorBlock. (un
 stable in newer builds)\n> - Liquid Glass Support\n> - - -\n> #### Extra T
 weaks:\n> - `YouPip` `YTABConfig` `YouQuality` `YouChooseQuality`  `YouGet
 Caption` `YTHoldForSpeed` `YTNativeShare` `YTweaks`\n> -  `Return-YouTube-
 Dislikes` `DontEatMyContent` `Open in YouTube (Safari Extension)` `Gonerin
 o` `VolumeBoostYT` `PleaseDontStopTheMusic`\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> - Extra twe
 aks that are bundled may be unstable on newer versions.\n\n> [!WARNING]\n>
  - 21.34.3+ builds require iOS 17+ now.
